# Workflow bundleids that must never be listed or reinstalled, one per line.
#
# Needed because workflows.txt is a UNION across machines now: without this,
# removing a workflow here would just be re-added by the next machine that
# still has it installed.
com.alfredapp.vitor.openai
# New Terminal Window: its Script Filter listed iTerm2 profiles and ran on
# `python` (python2, gone from macOS), and its actions drove iTerm and
# Terminal.app via osascript. The `tw` keyword in the generated dot workflow
# replaces it with Ghostty.
com.miromannino.new-terminal-window
